{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-marks-and-spencer-hand-painted-jug-2608-0112","content_id":"0281a37d-b708-4bbd-acde-f45bcfa672d8","description":"Product Recall for Marks and Spencer Hand Painted Jug presenting a risk of injuries. ","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"c86aec1e-a882-4993-86ec-d2c3d50175bf","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2026-08-14T10:48:36+01:00","id":"c86aec1e-a882-4993-86ec-d2c3d50175bf","title":"Link to Product Image and PDF","updated_at":"2026-08-14T10:48:36+01:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a7ee4741f783fe89daaa317/2608-0112-product-recall-m-and-s-hand-painted-jug.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: Marks and Spencer Hand Painted Jug</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The product presents a risk of injuries as the glass may break during use, leading to injuries.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The product has been withdrawn from the market and recalled from end users by Marks &amp; Spencer.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Kitchen/cooking accessories – Hand Painted Jug</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Brand</td>\n      <td>M&amp;S </td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Model</td>\n      <td>T34/9829D</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>China</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>Blue tinted jug with painted leaf decorations.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_c86aec1e-a882-4993-86ec-d2c3d50175bf\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a7ee4741f783fe89daaa317/2608-0112-product-recall-m-and-s-hand-painted-jug.pdf\">Link to Product Image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The product presents a risk of injuries as the glass may break during use, leading to injuries.  </p>\n\n<p>The product does not meet the requirements of the General Product Safety Regulations 2005.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The product has been withdrawn from the market and recalled from end users by Marks &amp; Spencer. Consumers should stop using the product immediately and return it to any Marks &amp; Spencer’s store for a full refund.  </p>\n\n<p>For more information, please access the M&amp;S website at: <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://www.marksandspencer.com/help-and-support/products-and-brands-information?intid=footernav_product-recalls\">Product and Brands Information - M&amp;S</a> or contact 0333 014 8434.</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD case number: 2608-0112</p>\n\n<p>Lead Authority: Local Authority Trading Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-08-14T09:49:35Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-recall","product_category":"kitchen-cooking-accessories","product_measure_type":["recall-of-product-from-end-users","withdrawal-of-product-from-market"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2026-08-14","product_risk_level":"not-provided"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2026-08-14T10:49:35+01:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-marks-and-spencer-hand-painted-jug-2608-0112","api_url":"https://www.